{"text": "In the morning Johnsy told Sue. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To pull up the shade. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After the beating rain. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And fierce wind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One ivy leaf. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Still hung against the brick wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was dark green. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Near the stem. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And yellow at the edges. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The leaf stayed there all day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And it was still there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through the second stormy night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have been a bad girl, Sudie. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Johnsy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Something has made that last leaf. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Stay there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To show me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How wicked I was. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is wrong. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To want to die. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she asked for some soup. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The doctor said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She is out of danger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And you have won. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But there is sad news, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He added. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Old Behrman has pneumonia. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And there is no hope for him.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "J", "o", "h", "n", "s", "y", " ", "t", "o", "l", "d", " ", "S", "u", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", " ", "p", "u", "l", "l", " ", "u", "p", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "h", "a", "d", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "a", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "r", "a", "i", "n", ".", " ", "<"